     <p style="line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">各位老师</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">：</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">为进一步挖掘</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">中小学课程蕴含的思想政治教育</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（德育教育）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">资源</span>,</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">着力</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">解决</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">好</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">各类课程与思政课</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">同向同行</span>,<span style="font-family:仿宋">形成课程思政</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（学科德育）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">建设的协同效应。</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">经研究决定，在全市范围内广泛征集评选中小学</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">课程思政</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">（德育）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">实践案例。请有意参评的老师于5月27日前将相关材料交于教科室。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">一、征集对象</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">绍兴市普通中小学</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">（含职校</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">、幼教</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">课任</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">教师</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">二、案例主要内容</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">1.<span style="font-family:仿宋">课程思政内容的来源</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">课程思政内容要紧紧围绕坚定学生理想信念</span>,<span style="font-family:仿宋">以爱党、爱国、爱社会主义、爱人民、爱集体为主线</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">,</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">围绕政治认同、家国情怀、文化素养、宪法法治意识、道德修养等重点优化课程思政内容供给</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">,</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">系统进行中国特色社会主义和中国梦教育、社会主义核心价值观教育、法治教育、劳动教育、心理健康教育、中华优秀传统文化教育</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">；</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:21px">德育</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">内容</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:21px">参照绍市教研字</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:21px">2020<span style="font-family:仿宋">（</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">52</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">号）文件规定</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">2.</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">案例必须是</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">真实的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">课程思政</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（德育）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">教学</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">实践，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">但并</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">不是工作介绍，而是反映</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">课程思政</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（德育）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">教学的过程</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">以及形成的结果和反思。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">既可以是成功的经验分享，也可以是</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">实践中遇到的困惑</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">求助。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">三、课程思政案例撰写要求</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">1.<span style="font-family:仿宋">案例格式</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">分成</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">3</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">个部分：</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:19px">教学设计</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:19px">（含</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:19px">标题）</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:19px">、课堂</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">实录（部分）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">、案例分析</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">2.<span style="font-family:仿宋">标题</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">题目应该比较简洁、或者能反映案例的主要思想，或者能抓住案例中的关键字词，不宜过长，不加副标题。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">3.<span style="font-family:仿宋">字数：</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">4</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">000-</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">6</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">000<span style="font-family:仿宋">字。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">4.<span style="font-family:仿宋">具体要求</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">教学设计</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:149px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">“课程思政” 设计书</span></p><table width="576" style="width: 551px;"><tbody><tr style="height:55px" class="firstRow"><td width="93" valign="center" style="padding: 1px 1px 0px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">案例名称</span></p></td><td width="483" valign="center" style="padding: 1px 1px 0px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
