</td></tr><tr style="height:67px"><td width="93" valign="center" style="padding: 1px 1px 0px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">课程思政教育目标</span></p></td><td width="483" valign="center" style="padding: 0px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;">
</td></tr><tr style="height:123px"><td width="93" valign="center" style="padding: 1px 1px 0px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">知识点与思政教育结合的教学设计</span></p></td><td width="483" valign="top" style="padding: 0px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;">
</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">课堂实录</span>(<span style="font-family:仿宋">部分</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">)</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">即把设计书中的</span>“</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">知识点与思政教育结合的教学设计</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">”以实录的方式呈现出来。这里不是完整的一节课，而是课程思政教学的片段。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">案例评析</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:32px;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px">主要阐述本课程思政教学的</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:等线">特色及创新</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px">点，具体可从以下一些方面进行思考</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋">）根据案例本身进行分析</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">做法合理或不合理，好或不好，好在哪里？或者，不好在哪里？（是什么）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">结合相关理论或自己的认识与经验角度，谈为什么好或不好；（为什么）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">有没有其他更好的解决方法或建议（可以基于经验、或者基于理论）；（怎么办）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">（</span>2<span style="font-family:仿宋">）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">也可以是</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">延伸性分析</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">即从案例中延伸出对一类问题的分析或看法。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">特别说明：案例分析的逻辑与思考题提出的逻辑可以一一对应，也可以不用一一对应。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">（</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">3<span style="font-family:仿宋">）也可以有</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">基于案例的思考</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">即提一些思考题</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">如：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">从案例本身的角度提问</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">第一，对案例中的系列问题展开提问</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">；</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">第二，从与案例相关人员的角度展开提问</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">又如：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">从案例以外的角度（延伸性问题）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">四、德育案例撰写要求</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">包含案例呈现、案例分析与思考等，具体详见附件参考样例。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">五、</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">课程思政</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">（德育）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">案例征集推荐名额分配</span></span></strong></p><table width="542"><tbody><tr style="height:28px" class="firstRow"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 2px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">市直</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">越城区</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">柯桥区</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">上虞区</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">嵊州市</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">新昌县</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">诸暨市</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: windowtext; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">合计</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:28px"><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 2px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> 30</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> 30</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> 30</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> 30</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> 30</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> 30</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"> 40</span></p></td><td width="68" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">20</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">0</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:24px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">注：上报比例：课程思政与德育：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">6<span style="font-family:仿宋">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">六、其</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px">它</span></strong></p><p style="margin-right: 25px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 39px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">1<span style="font-family:仿宋">．请作者把</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">课程思政（注明类别：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">、</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">德育（注明类别：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">分类的序号直接填入案例封面扉页左上角空格中（附件</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">，绍兴名师可直接申报</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">。若有案例相关的照片、视频，请附文件夹，文件夹名为：姓名</span>+<span style="font-family:仿宋">案例名称。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">2.</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">各区、县（市）教科所要高度重视本次案例征集工作，积极发动学校广泛参与。在初评的基础上汇总（附件</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">），择优上报纸质稿</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">份、电子稿</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋">份。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">3.</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">市直以学校为单位上报</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">，每校不超过</span>5<span style="font-family:仿宋">篇</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right: 25px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">4.</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">绍兴名师可直接申报</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-right: 25px;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">5.</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">若有案例相关的照片、视频，请附文件夹，文件夹名为：姓名</span>+<span style="font-family:仿宋">案例名称。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">6.</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">上报截止时间</span>2022</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">年</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">5</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">27</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">日。联系人：王佩金</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">钉钉。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:39px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">7</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">．</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">届时组织专家对所征集案例进行评审：第一轮评审拟获奖案例，我们将组织专家对案例作者进行专题指导、修改。第二轮正式评审，对获奖的优秀案例开展专项评估、指导并结集</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">成册</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p>附件1：<span style="text-align: center;">绍兴市中小学幼儿园课程思政</span><span style="text-align: center;">、</span><span style="text-align: center;">德育案例</span><span style="text-align: center;">申报表</span></p><p><span style="text-align: center;">附件2：</span><span style="text-align: center;">绍兴市中小学幼儿园课程思政、德育案例汇总</span><span style="text-align: center;">表</span></p><p><span style="text-align: center;">附件3：</span><span style="text-align: center;">课程思政案例 样例（仅供参考）</span></p><p><span style="text-align: center;">附件4：</span><span style="text-align: center;">德育案例 样例（仅供参</span><span style="text-align: center;">考）</span></p><p><span style="text-align: center;"></span>附件1~4下载：</p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/3/202203180917476170.docx" title="202203180917476170.docx">202203180917476170.docx</a></p><p><span style="text-align: center;"></span>
</p><p><span style="text-align: center;"></span>
</p><p>
</p>
    
